{"id":"vod_md_2510","vodId":"2510","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"花丸幼稚园","name_cn":"花丸幼稚园","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230816-1/f2b39ece507c2f47203741209d8a603d.jpg"},"summary":"目前，超级宅男土田直纯（日野聪 配音）在一所名叫花丸的幼稚园中担任老师的职务，在可爱的小朋友们的围绕下，每天都过着充满欢笑的生活。在个性单纯直率的杏（真堂圭 配音）的眼中，土田老师是世界上最最优秀的男人，她无视巨大的年龄差距，发誓漫长的余生，非他不嫁。在好友小梅（樱井真子 配音）和柊（高垣彩阳 配音）的帮助下，杏锲而不舍的一次又一次向土田老师发动着恋爱进攻。可是，土田早就有了心上人——隔壁班的老师山本菜菜子（叶月絵理乃 配音）。不过，个性有些迟钝和天然呆的山本似乎对土田的心意没有半分察觉。在花丸幼稚园里，一出出轻松愉快的恋爱喜剧每一天都在上演着。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-16 08:11:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/nXA3lANd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/OwT3Z3Uh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/5krBsjWR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/oGDhXSM3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/BeV2SExS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/f4OfZN4Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/roa6ADYF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/eHTb1yps/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/NMrQ0xcV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/2vu6sZYL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/gydBnAik/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/oZbizV3Q/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:34.417Z"}